@startuml architecture
!pragma layout smetana
title M6 runtime responsibilities (Host and Client processes)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
footer Shutdown: connections, engine, adapters, then diagnostics
component "Host\ncreates dependencies" as Host
component "Client process\nContracts DTO only" as Client
component "Host\nNamed Pipe / Dispatcher" as Server
component "Core\nInspectionEngine" as Engine
component "Core\nInspectionRunner" as Core
component "SimulatedDevice\noptional Host acquisition delay" as Device
component "Infrastructure\nRangeInspector" as Inspector
component "Interop\nNativeInspector" as Native
component "C++/CLI\nCliInspector / CliNativeApi" as Cli
component "NativeInspection.dll\nC ABI / worker and progress callbacks" as DLL
component "Infrastructure\nJSON / SQLite result store" as Store
database "JSON files / SQLite DB" as Result
component "Host\nJSONL diagnostics\nclosed last" as Log
Host --> Engine : start / status / stop
Client <--> Server
Host --> Server : owns connections
Server --> Engine : short admission and control calls
Server --> Store
Server --> Log
Engine --> Log : IInspectionDiagnostics
Host ..> Log
Engine --> Core : one run / sequential repetition
Host ..> Engine : awaits disposal before adapters
Core --> Device : IDevice
Core --> Inspector : IInspector (managed)
Core --> Native : IInspector (native)
Core --> Cli : IInspector (cli)
Cli --> Native : owns shared lifetime
Cli --> DLL : C++ direct calls
Native --> DLL : LibraryImport (default transport)
Core --> Store : IResultStore
Store --> Result
note bottom of Core
Calls ports declared by Core.
No dependency on adapter assemblies.
end note
@enduml
